1
00:00:11,625 --> 00:00:12,916
Is he really the Godfather?

2
00:00:14,125 --> 00:00:15,083
Why do you ask?

3
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:18,208
If he really is the
ruler of the Sovereign Sanctum...

4
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:21,000
why is House Carter
stuck ruling this tiny city?

5
00:00:21,875 --> 00:00:24,125
Because Count Carter never respected him.

6
00:00:26,041 --> 00:00:27,791
If you don't respect
a man like that…

7
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,083
he has no obligation
to make you powerful.

8
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:33,041
But, i-if he 
really is the Godfather,

9
00:00:33,541 --> 00:00:35,000
why would he be
digging in the mines?

10
00:00:35,083 --> 00:00:36,625
The Godfather is still only human.

11
00:00:36,875 --> 00:00:37,916
Even he needs rest.

12
00:00:39,041 --> 00:00:39,583
I see.

13
00:00:40,041 --> 00:00:40,458
Sandero,

14
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:41,875
never doubt a man who defeated you.

15
00:00:41,875 --> 00:00:43,625
No one else on Golantis could do that. 

16
00:00:44,083 --> 00:00:45,958
The kind of power others kill
for…

17
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,416
probably means nothing to him.

18
00:00:48,875 --> 00:00:49,583
Let’s go.

19
00:01:09,750 --> 00:01:13,083
Clan Leader Ais sends
150,000 gold coins!

20
00:01:13,208 --> 00:01:16,458
The Yale family sends
200,000 gold coins!

21
00:01:16,875 --> 00:01:19,458
The Lord of Amberwater
City sends 200,000

22
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:22,000
gold coins and fifteen magic crystals!

23
00:01:22,958 --> 00:01:24,333
 It's gorgeous.

24
00:01:24,333 --> 00:01:25,750
Absolutely.

25
00:01:37,625 --> 00:01:39,916
Countess, your family really is...

26
00:01:40,875 --> 00:01:41,625
pathetic.

27
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:45,500
The eldest son of
House Carter gets 
married,

28
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:47,916
and there’s not
a single notable gift?

29
00:01:47,916 --> 00:01:49,125
This is the Holy Cathedral!

30
00:01:49,500 --> 00:01:51,750
Filthy peasants are not allowed!

31
00:01:52,041 --> 00:01:53,583
We got an invitation!See?

32
00:01:57,333 --> 00:01:58,166
They’re with me.

33
00:01:58,916 --> 00:01:59,750
Let them through.

34
00:02:07,333 --> 00:02:08,208
Roll with me.

35
00:02:16,250 --> 00:02:18,083
How do we know he didn't steal it?

36
00:02:19,333 --> 00:02:21,458
Ugh, he smells like a mine.

37
00:02:21,583 --> 00:02:22,666
It's disgusting.

38
00:02:23,666 --> 00:02:25,708
Severin, congrats, man!

39
00:02:29,833 --> 00:02:30,916
I don’t have much, 

40
00:02:33,125 --> 00:02:36,083
but put
me down for three copper coins.

41
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:39,000
Same here. Three coppers from me.
